/ `lib.codec.decode(material, rep, transform, key)` (unknown names -> None => decode by shape)."," Reps: base64 (literal/chunks/urlsafe/reversed), hex (pairs/compact/colon/dash/`\\x`/`0x`/buffer/array), percent_hex,","-escaped_octets, unicode_escapes, decimal lists (any separator)/json_numbers/integer_list/tuple, octal_space, reversed_text/_hex/","-_decimal/_integer_list, plain/split_fragments, v=3 hex_base64. Transforms (key hex; multi-byte = COMMA list): identity (also","-EMPTY), reverse, single_byte_xor, repeating_key_xor, reverse_then_xor, rolling_xor, add_modulo_256 (decode SUBTRACTS),","-subtract_modulo_256 (decode ADDS); batch names carry the parameter (xor_5a, add_7 decimal); bash `xor_hex|<key>` = unhex then","-XOR. Check: plaintext starts `v=` (or `{`), else the codec reading is wrong.","+escaped_octets, unicode_escapes, decimal lists/json_numbers/integer_list/tuple, octal_space, reversed_text/_hex/_decimal/","+_integer_list, plain/split_fragments, v=3 hex_base64, D23 LYR stacks. Transforms (key hex; multi-byte = COMMA list): identity","+(also EMPTY), reverse(_bytes), single_byte_xor, repeating_key_xor, reverse_then_xor, rolling_xor, add_modulo_256 (decode","+SUBTRACTS), subtract_modulo_256 (decode ADDS); batch names carry the parameter (xor_5a, add_7); bash `xor_hex|<key>`."," "," ## Day by day","-**D1-D7 (PS -> +JScript -> +Batch -> +VBScript -> +Python -> +Bash -> +Node, 469 ids)**: D1 collection ATT&CK cost 5 wrong before","-`T1555.003`; D2 handoff = `staged_chain`, 7 wrong ATT&CK guesses; **D3 ~1 h 45 min, ~127 rejected probes** on batch","-expansion/control labels -> NAMING LAWS; D4 VBS control probed one field at a time (4 wrong); D5-D6 0 wrong (~4 min; stage_count =","-plan field); D7 469/469 in ~100 s, TT missed 15 ids on new reps + one `rate_limited` body saved as the zip.","-**D8-D15 (+PHP polyglot & hosts, Lua/SCT/OpenResty, MOF, TS, AutoIt, AppleScript, MSBuild, Perl; 615 -> 1026 ids)**: D8 introduced","-v=3 (copy role/attack/adapter/profiles,