nux-package-maintainer-scripts + macos-pkg-installer-scripts still pending.\nThe queue below is rebuilt from the D23 direction: (1) timed-contract grammar + layered tags + corpus cross-references (the\nreal D23 cost), (2) game-engine / game-modding script languages and their resource containers (the title thread).\n'''\nt = t.replace(old_head, new_head)\n\nt = t.replace('- ~9 drops left (D23-D31).', '''- ~8 drops left (D24-D31). D23 opened a fourth thread: (d) **game engines / modding** (Godot GDScript seen D23 -> Godot\n  `.tscn`/`.tres` resources with embedded `script/source`, `.pck` packs, Roblox Luau, Ren'Py `.rpy`/`.rpyc`, GameMaker GML,\n  Squirrel `.nut`, AngelScript, Pawn, Minecraft `.mcfunction`/datapacks, UnrealScript/Blueprint text, Unity C#). And the\n  timed-contract grammar is now a moving part on its own: expect the single to adopt the per-file shape, more LYR layer names,\n  and more cross-file (corpus) questions.''')\n\n# 2. row 49 + 66 updates\nr49_old = [l for l in t.splitlines() if l.startswith('| 49 |')][0]\nr49_new = ('| 49 | v=3 marker tags B64 / HEX / HB64 / FRAG (+ D18 layout tag SPLIT, D19 escaped nesting, D23 `LYR-<layers>`) | seen '\n 'D8-D23 | `HUNTRESS_ANALYSIS_V1:<TAG>-`; D18 `:SPLIT` with no data + multi-line `[..].join(\"\")` array; **D23 timed `LYR-hex_b64_'\n 'hex-<data>`** (1-3 layers from b64/b32/hex/rev/frag, ENCODE order; Apps Script splits it across an array) | D23 solve.py '\n '`LYR_RE`/`_lyr_peel` (undo layers last-first; obfuscation answer = the layer string verbatim) + `_v3_peel` shape fallback; '\n 'lib.codec `v3_peel_widen` (B32/Z64/..); LYR NOT in lib yet (gap lyr-tag-layer-peel) | carried; next: new layer names '\n '(z85/a85/gz/xor/rot13/url) or 4+ layers = **high** |')\nt = t.replace(r49_old, r49_new)\nr66_old = [l for l in t.splitlines() if l.startswith('| 66 |')][0]\nt = t.replace(r66_old, r66_old.replace('gap (prompts D8, D15, D16; never asked)',\n    'gap (prompts D8, D15, D16, D23 \"the level that doesn\\'t belon